meta {
  name: Identities - Disconnect
  type: http
  seq: 153
}

delete {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/user/identities/v76f8v6cw1zyl5wqxoucchmp
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Disconnect a provider account, by identity cuid (#1385). You keep your account, its email address and its sessions: a sign-in link or a password reset still works. Returns 204. The identity of another member gives 404. Needs identities:write (not in the default set).
}
